.TH GETTID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
gettid \- returns the calling linux thread id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B pid_t gettid(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the calling Linux thread ID.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gettid (2)
